## Overview

Forter delivers real-time trust decisions across the customer
lifecycle - login, signup, checkout, payment, refund, chargeback -
backed by an identity graph spanning 1B+ identities and trillions of
transactions across 300+ digital-first merchants including
**Nordstrom**, **ASOS**, **eBay**, **Priceline**, **Sephora**, and
**Instacart**.

Founded in [2013](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forter), headquartered
at 575 5th Avenue, 29th Floor, New York, NY 10017. Industry: fraud
prevention / e-commerce. Privately held.

