  `Api-Version` headers. **Credentials are provisioned by your Forter
  Account Manager / Customer Success (CSM)** under a signed Master
  Services Agreement (MSA). Start at
  [contact-us](https://www.forter.com/contact-us/).
- **Production MCP server** at `mcp.forter.com/mcp`: OAuth 2.0 + PKCE.
  **Provisioned by Forter Account Management (CSM)** under a signed
  MSA - the demo surface at `www.forter.com/mcp` and `www.forter.com/oauth/*`
  do NOT issue production credentials.
- **Demo MCP server** at
  [www.forter.com/mcp](https://www.forter.com/mcp): local mock MCP
  with anonymous JSON-RPC, MCP Apps `ui://` cards (decisions, login-
  risk, agent-trust), and demo OAuth 2.1 at
  [/oauth/*](https://www.forter.com/oauth/). Tokens issued in one
  round-trip via `POST /oauth/token grant_type=client_credentials`.
  Metadata at
  [oauth-authorization-server](https://www.forter.com/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server)
  and
  [oauth-protected-resource](https://www.forter.com/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource)
  (RFC 9728). JWKS at
  [oauth/jwks.json](https://www.forter.com/oauth/jwks.json) (HS256 -
  empty keys list).
- **Demo `agent_auth` surface** at `www.forter.com/agent/*`:
  WorkOS-style prose walkthrough at
  [/auth.md](https://www.forter.com/auth.md). Self-serve sandbox
  bearer (`demo_*`) issued in one round-trip from
  `POST /agent/register`. **Sandbox tokens do NOT grant access to
  production data** - they're recognized only by the demo endpoints
  on `www.forter.com`. For production credentials contact your Forter
  account manager / CSM via
  [contact-us](https://www.forter.com/contact-us/).
- **Web Bot Auth (RFC 9421)**: Ed25519 key directory at
  [http-message-signatures-directory](https://www.forter.com/.well-known/http-message-signatures-directory).
  Published-key JWKS at
  [/.well-known/jwks.json](https://www.forter.com/.well-known/jwks.json)
  (separate from the demo OAuth JWKS).
- See [migrate-to-pre-auth](https://docs.forter.com/migrate-to-pre-auth)
